			</header>

		<div id="fsPageBodyWrapper" class="fsPageBodyWrapper">
			<div id="fsPageBody" class="fsStyleAutoclear fsPageBody">

				<main id="fsPageContent" class="fsPageContent">
							<h1 class="fsPageTitle">Referendum</h1>




							<div class="fsPageLayout fsLayout fsOneColumnLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_7171" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_7172"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnWideLeftLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8684" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleTwoThirds fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8685"  >

				<section class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_7173" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h3 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_7173">Welcome to our Referendum Site!</h3>
			<div class="fsElementHeaderContent">
				<figure class="fsImage"><picture><img alt="The front entrance to West Essex Regional School District with a banner that read &quot;WE Focus on the Future&quot; superimposed on top." data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1790636111/westexorg/pzeviouh8owil4pu2n3k/810282130_4623984791224573_6723524935475987845_n.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1790636111/westexorg/pzeviouh8owil4pu2n3k/810282130_4623984791224573_6723524935475987845_n.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1790636111/westexorg/pzeviouh8owil4pu2n3k/810282130_4623984791224573_6723524935475987845_n.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1790636111/westexorg/pzeviouh8owil4pu2n3k/810282130_4623984791224573_6723524935475987845_n.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1790636111/westexorg/pzeviouh8owil4pu2n3k/810282130_4623984791224573_6723524935475987845_n.jpg%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1790636111/westexorg/pzeviouh8owil4pu2n3k/810282130_4623984791224573_6723524935475987845_n.jpg%22,%22width%22:2000}]" data-resource-description="" data-resource-filename="810282130_4623984791224573_6723524935475987845_n.jpg" data-resource-uuid="4e74a05d-51b2-4f1e-aff6-89bc99cf6fa1" src="" /></picture></figure>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

			</div>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>The West Essex Regional School District Board of Education, in conjunction with the district administration, has identified the need to pursue a <strong>bond</strong>&nbsp;<strong>referendum </strong>to address critical facility needs within our schools.&nbsp;Decisions will be made with the goal of maximizing value for taxpayers while investing wisely in our students&rsquo; future.<br />
<br />
Clear and consistent communication remains a priority throughout this process. Updates and resources will continue to be posted on this page, and key information will also be shared through the district&rsquo;s social media platforms, including <a href="https://www.instagram.com/westessexnj/">Instagram</a>&nbsp;and <strong><a href="https://www.facebook.com/westessexregionalschool/" target="_blank">Facebook</a></strong>.</p>


	</div>


	</section>
	



	</div>
	
	<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleOneThird fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-2 fsStyleColumn-last fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8686"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsNavigation fsList nav-sub" id="fsEl_8687" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<nav><ul class="fsNavLevel1"><li><a href="/about/referendum/proposed-projects">Proposed Projects</a></li><li><a href="/about/referendum/funding-details">Funding Details</a></li><li><a href="/about/referendum/faqs">Referendum FAQs</a></li><li><a href="/about/referendum/voter-information">Voter Information</a></li></ul></nav>
	</div>


	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsResourceElement fsSingleItem" id="fsEl_8746" data-use-new="true" data-source-element-id="8746" data-source-page-id="1315" data-display-items="collections_and_resources" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<article class="fsResource fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><a class="fsResourceLink" data-permitted-user="true" data-preview="false" data-resource-title="WE_Round-Logo.png" data-resource-type="Image" href="/referendum"><picture><img alt="" data-aspect-ratio="1.0" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1790636186/westexorg/qrxwkqkwtkpg5grumden/WE_Round-Logo.png%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1790636186/westexorg/qrxwkqkwtkpg5grumden/WE_Round-Logo.png%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1790636186/westexorg/qrxwkqkwtkpg5grumden/WE_Round-Logo.png%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1790636186/westexorg/qrxwkqkwtkpg5grumden/WE_Round-Logo.png%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1790636186/westexorg/qrxwkqkwtkpg5grumden/WE_Round-Logo.png%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1790636186/westexorg/qrxwkqkwtkpg5grumden/WE_Round-Logo.png%22,%22width%22:1729}]" data-permitted-user="true" data-resource-title="WE_Round-Logo.png" data-resource-uuid="0c456ef6-deab-4585-8a88-d4f494dbb506"></picture></a></figure></article>
	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	




	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-dark" id="fsEl_8449" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<h2 style="text-align: center;">Our Complete Referendum Proposal</h2>

<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #fff; font-size: 16px;"><strong>West Essex Regional School District buildings are well-maintained, but the time has come for us to replace and upgrade the systems and structures that serve our high-achieving district.</strong></span></p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.westex.org/about/referendum/proposed-projects" title="Link takes you to referendum projects page"><span class="button-on-dark-2">Learn More About Our Proposed Projects &amp; Watch Our Referendum Video</span></a></p>


	</div>


	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsThreeColumnLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8572" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8573"  >

				<section class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_7800" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h3 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_7800">Learn More About Funding & Tax Impact</h3>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>West Essex&nbsp;will receive <strong>$9.3 million in state aid</strong> to reduce the local cost of the projects if both ballot questions are approved. The bond proposal aligns with the district&rsquo;s history of strategic fiscal planning and mission to provide safe, functional, and effective learning environments.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Click below to learn more about the total cost, estimated tax impact, and the district&#39;s history of fiscal responsibility.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a data-page-name="Funding Details" href="/fs/pages/1385" title="Link takes you to referendum funding information webpage"><span class="button-4">Learn More</span></a></p>


	</div>


	</section>
	



	</div>
	
	<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-2 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8574"  >

				<section class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_8576" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h3 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8576">Answering Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p style="text-align: left;">We are pleased to share a set of <strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong> (FAQs) related to school referendums and our district&rsquo;s planning efforts. These FAQs are designed to address common questions about what a referendum is, why it is being considered, how priorities are determined, and how community members can stay informed and involved.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a data-page-name="Referendum FAQs" href="/fs/pages/1380" title="Link takes you to referendum faqs page."><span class="button-4">Referendum FAQS</span></a><a href="mailto:vote@westex.org" target="_blank" title="Link opens email to vote@westex.org"><span class="button-4">Email Us at vote@westex.org</span></a></p>


	</div>


	</section>
	



	</div>
	
	<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-3 fsStyleColumn-last fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8575"  >

				<section class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_8577" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h3 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8577">Voter Information</h3>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>Our bond referendum will appear as 2 questions on the Nov. 3 general election ballot. <strong>Every vote counts, so your participation is important!&nbsp;</strong>We are happy to provide info&nbsp;about:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Voting in-person (early or on Election Day)</li>
	<li>Voting&nbsp;by mail</li>
	<li>Checking your voter registration</li>
	<li>What the ballot looks like</li>
</ul>

<p>and more!</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a data-page-name="Voter Information" href="/fs/pages/1389" title="Link takes you to referendum voting information webpage"><span class="button-4">Learn More</span></a></p>


	</div>


	</section>
	



	</div>
	




	</div>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsPanelGroup fsAccordion fsPanelIconBefore" id="fsEl_8456" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8456">Latest Update (10/30/26) – Weekly Referendum Letter #13 (Reminder: Vote on November 3rd)</h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
		    <ul class="fsTabsNav" role="tablist">
        
            <li id="fsTab-8457" class="fsTabsNavItem " role="presentation">
                <a role='tab' aria-selected='false' href='#fs-panel-8457' aria-controls='fsEl_8457'>Read More</a>
                
            </li>

    </ul>

    	<section class="fsElement fsPanel fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8457" data-use-new="true" role="tabpanel" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8457"><a role='button' aria-controls='fsPanelContent_8457' aria-expanded='false' href='#fs-panel-8457'>Read More</a></h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" aria-hidden="true">
		<a id="fs-panel-8457"></a>
	<section class="fsElement fsContainer callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_8917" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h3 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8917">Update 30 - Superintendent & Board President Share Weekly Letter 13 About Remembering to Vote on Nov 3 (October 30, 2026)</h3>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_8922" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>Dear West Essex School Community,</p>

<p>The November 3 bond referendum is just days away. This vote marks an important step in the future of the West Essex Regional School District, and we encourage all eligible voters to make a plan to participate.</p>

<p>If both ballot questions are approved, the district will receive $9.3 million in state aid to help offset project costs and reduce the impact on local taxpayers. State aid is available only if the referendum is approved.&nbsp;</p>

<p>As Election Day approaches, here is a reminder of your voting options:</p>

<ul>
	<li><u><strong>Vote by Mail</strong></u>: Ballots must be postmarked by Tuesday, November 3, to be counted. You may also return your ballot to a designated local ballot drop box.</li>
	<li><u><strong>Early In-Person Voting</strong></u>: Early voting ends Sunday, November 1. Polling sites are open 10 a.m. to 8 p.m. Friday and Saturday and 10 a.m. to 6 p.m. Sunday. Registered voters can vote at any designated early voting location in the county, including the Fairfield Community Center (221 Hollywood Ave.) and Verona Community Center (880 Bloomfield Ave.).&nbsp;</li>
	<li><u><strong>Election Day</strong></u>: Polls will be open from 6 a.m. to 8 p.m. Tuesday, November 3. Look up your polling location at <a href="https://www.westex.org/vote" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to election site.">www.westex.org/vote</a>. &nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
	<li><u><strong>Provisional Ballots</strong></u>: If you encounter an issue with your voter registration or eligibility at the polls, ask a poll worker about casting a provisional ballot. This allows election officials to review your eligibility before determining whether your vote can be counted.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
</ul>

<p>Every vote matters, and we appreciate your time and participation in this important decision for our school community.</p>

<p>Election results will be shared as they become available at <a href="https://www.westex.org/vote" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to election site.">www.westex.org/vote</a>. &nbsp;</p>

<p>Sincerely,</p>

<p>Damion Macioci, <em>Superintendent of Schools</em><br />
Maryadele Wojtowicz, <em>Board of Education President</em></p>


	</div>


	</div>
	


	</div>


	</section>
	


	</div>


	</section>
	



	</div>


	</section>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsPanelGroup fsAccordion fsPanelIconBefore" id="fsEl_8320" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8320">Referendum Timeline</h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
		    <ul class="fsTabsNav" role="tablist">
        
            <li id="fsTab-8321" class="fsTabsNavItem " role="presentation">
                <a role='tab' aria-selected='false' href='#fs-panel-8321' aria-controls='fsEl_8321'>Learn more about the timeline and process of our referendum.</a>
                
            </li>

    </ul>

    	<section class="fsElement fsPanel fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8321" data-use-new="true" role="tabpanel" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8321"><a role='button' aria-controls='fsPanelContent_8321' aria-expanded='false' href='#fs-panel-8321'>Learn more about the timeline and process of our referendum.</a></h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" aria-hidden="true">
		<a id="fs-panel-8321"></a>
	<div class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-light color-2" id="fsEl_8682" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p><strong>Summer 2025</strong> - The Board of Education identified the need to pursue a bond referendum as a means to generate upfront funds and secure state aid for critical facility improvements.&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>Fall 2025</strong> - District administration and the Board of Education, in partnership with the district architect, assessed facilities and planned a demographic study to ensure that long-term plans align with future needs.</p>

<p><strong>Winter 2025-26</strong>&nbsp;- District leadership continued&nbsp;to work with the architects, financial advisor and bond counsel to ensure that the plan upholds its fiscal responsibility to the community.&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>Late Winter/Early Spring 2026</strong> - Project applications were&nbsp;sent to the New Jersey Department of Education for review and state aid determination. This mandatory state review helped determine the amount of state aid eligibility for proposed projects, and the estimated tax impact.</p>

<p><strong>Early Summer 2026</strong> - Upon completion of the state&rsquo;s review, the Board of Education received&nbsp;a letter of eligibility with the state aid figures. The Board reviewed the funding and finalized the details of the ballot, including project scope and estimated tax impact. After the ballot was finalized, the district launched a multi-faceted communications campaign to share the details of the proposal and engage with the entire community.</p>

<p><strong>Fall 2026 </strong>- The vote will take&nbsp;place in the fall of 2026 <a data-page-name="Voter Information" href="/fs/pages/1389" title="Link takes you to referendum voting information page.">(November 3)</a>.</p>

<hr />
<div style="text-align:center">
<figure class="fsImage" style="display:inline-block"><picture><img alt="Red-and-white referendum graphic titled “Proposed Project Timeline,” listing school construction and renovation projects from 2027 to 2028, with a West Essex logo and website." data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1792775023/westexorg/pee7ghhtux40trqg9wi6/OCT23.png%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1792775023/westexorg/pee7ghhtux40trqg9wi6/OCT23.png%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1792775023/westexorg/pee7ghhtux40trqg9wi6/OCT23.png%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1792775023/westexorg/pee7ghhtux40trqg9wi6/OCT23.png%22,%22width%22:1080}]" data-resource-description="" data-resource-filename="OCT23.png" data-resource-uuid="7914f20f-bb7c-4c63-aee2-3e6b54726776" src="" width="474" /></picture></figure>
</div>

<p>&nbsp;</p>


	</div>


	</div>
	


	</div>


	</section>
	



	</div>


	</section>
	
