	<section class="fsElement fsPanel fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8452" data-use-new="true" role="tabpanel" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8452"><a role='button' aria-controls='fsPanelContent_8452' aria-expanded='false' href='#fs-panel-8452'>8/9/2026 | Weekly Referendum Email 1</a></h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" aria-hidden="true">
		<a id="fs-panel-8452"></a>
	<section class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_8454" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h4 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8454">Update 18 - Superintendent & Board President Announce Weekly Letters, Share Letter 1 (August 7, 2026)</h4>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p style="text-align: justify;">Dear West Essex School Community,</p>

<p style="text-align: justify;">Over the next several weeks, we will be sharing a series of brief emails explaining the proposed November 3 bond referendum. Each message will focus on one topic so our community can better understand the projects being considered and the reasons behind them.</p>

<p style="text-align: justify;">This week, we would like to answer a simple question: <em><strong>Why is a referendum needed</strong></em>?</p>

<p style="text-align: justify;">Our middle and high school buildings have served generations of students well. While they have been carefully maintained over the years, many building components date back to the original construction in the 1960s and are reaching the end of their useful life.</p>

<p style="text-align: justify;">Routine maintenance can address everyday repairs, but larger projects, such as replacing aging infrastructure, modernizing learning spaces, and improving school security, are beyond what can reasonably be funded through the annual operating budget.</p>

<p style="text-align: justify;">A bond referendum provides an opportunity for voters to decide whether these long-term improvements should move forward, with eligible projects receiving financial support from the State of New Jersey.</p>

<p style="text-align: justify;">Our goal throughout this process is simple: provide clear, factual information so every resident can make an informed decision on November 3.</p>

<p style="text-align: justify;">Thank you for your continued interest.</p>

<p>Sincerely,<br />
Damion Macioci, <em>Superintendent of Schools</em><br />
Maryadele Wojtowicz, <em>Board of Education President</em></p>


	</div>


	</section>
	


	</div>


	</section>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsPanel fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8440" data-use-new="true" role="tabpanel" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8440"><a role='button' aria-controls='fsPanelContent_8440' aria-expanded='false' href='#fs-panel-8440'>7/15/2026 | Tax Impact, State Aid Figures Announced</a></h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" aria-hidden="true">
		<a id="fs-panel-8440"></a>
	<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnWideLeftLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8442" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleTwoThirds fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8443"  >

				<section class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_8444" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h4 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8444">Update 17 – Board Announces Preliminary Tax Impact & State Aid Figures (July 15, 2026)</h4>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>During the July 15<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;meeting, the Board and District Administration provided preliminary referendum cost estimates and state aid figures, as well as next steps.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a data-file-name="PresentationforJuly15BOEMeeting1.pdf" data-resource-uuid="1e772acd-35f1-477b-8e45-b844879c64b3" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/1e772acd-35f1-477b-8e45-b844879c64b3" target="_blank"><span class="button-large-1">Meeting Presentation &amp; Numbers</span></a></p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/h6tgoCfurf0?si=RI89V98-buOWGKmC" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to YouTube recording of referendum video."><span class="button-large-1">Meeting Recording</span></a></p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a data-file-name="LettertoCommunity-07-16-26.pdf" data-resource-uuid="14a5021b-0322-47cb-b1c8-f9ff9efaf938" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/14a5021b-0322-47cb-b1c8-f9ff9efaf938" target="_blank"><span class="button-large-1">Community Letter</span></a></p>

<h1 style="text-align: center;"><a data-file-name="ReferendumPresentationMay11.pdf" data-resource-uuid="fcd43248-0ca7-48eb-ab7b-11ba4c47ee10" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/fcd43248-0ca7-48eb-ab7b-11ba4c47ee10" target="_blank"><em><span class="button-link">Complete Referendum Proposal (5/11/2026)</span></em></a></h1>

<h3 style="text-align: center;"><a data-file-name="WestEssexRegionalProjection2025-26a.pdf" data-resource-uuid="20c234af-550d-456f-abc6-06f2f4299bb2" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/20c234af-550d-456f-abc6-06f2f4299bb2" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to PDF slideshow of Referendum Demographic study."><em><span class="button-link">Demographic Study</span></em></a></h3>


	</div>


	</section>
	



	</div>
	
	<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleOneThird fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-2 fsStyleColumn-last fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8445"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsResourceElement fsSingleItem" id="fsEl_8446" data-use-new="true" data-source-element-id="8446" data-source-page-id="1315" data-display-items="collections_and_resources" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<article class="fsResource fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><picture><img alt="Referendum graphic with information regarding video presentation." data-aspect-ratio="1.25" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1784207723/westexorg/sgi89xiywvzvz4uidvvb/July16Post.png%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1784207723/westexorg/sgi89xiywvzvz4uidvvb/July16Post.png%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1784207723/westexorg/sgi89xiywvzvz4uidvvb/July16Post.png%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1784207723/westexorg/sgi89xiywvzvz4uidvvb/July16Post.png%22,%22width%22:1080}]" data-permitted-user="true" data-resource-title="July16Post.png" data-resource-uuid="165a9bce-735a-4b6f-a2b1-6b53bed285b2"></picture></figure></article>
	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	




	</div>
	


	</div>


	</section>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsPanel fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8317" data-use-new="true" role="tabpanel" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8317"><a role='button' aria-controls='fsPanelContent_8317' aria-expanded='false' href='#fs-panel-8317'>7/7/2026 | Invite to July 15 Meeting, Tax Impact Announced</a></h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" aria-hidden="true">
		<a id="fs-panel-8317"></a>
	<section class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_8319" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h4 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8319">Update 16 - Meeting Scheduled for July 15, Preliminary Costs To Be Shared (Community Letters on July 7 & 13, 2026)</h4>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p style="text-align: justify;">Dear West Essex Community,</p>

<p>As you know, the West Essex Board of Education is planning a bond referendum on November 3. We invite you to join us for our next Board meeting on Wednesday, July 15, at 6:00 p.m. in the West Essex Middle School cafeteria classroom, where we will share important updates.</p>

<p>The district has received preliminary project cost estimates and state aid eligibility information from the New Jersey Department of Education. During the meeting, we will share these preliminary figures and provide an update on the next steps in the referendum planning process.</p>

<p>If you are unable to attend in person, the meeting will be livestreamed and recorded. The recording will be posted on the&nbsp;<a data-page-name="Referendum" href="/fs/pages/1369" title="Link takes you to West Essex referendum site.">district website</a>, and the meeting will also be available on the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.youtube.com/@WestEssex/streams" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to WE Youtube page">West Essex YouTube</a>&nbsp;channel.</p>

<p>We appreciate your continued interest and look forward to keeping you informed as additional information becomes available.</p>

<p>Sincerely,<br />
Damion Macioci, <em>Superintendent of Schools</em><br />
Maryadele Wojtowicz, <em>Board of Education President</em></p>


	</div>


	</section>
	


	</div>


	</section>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsPanel fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8262" data-use-new="true" role="tabpanel" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8262"><a role='button' aria-controls='fsPanelContent_8262' aria-expanded='false' href='#fs-panel-8262'>5/11/2026 | Detailed Referendum Overview at Meeting</a></h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" aria-hidden="true">
		<a id="fs-panel-8262"></a>
	<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnWideLeftLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8264" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleTwoThirds fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8265"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_8267" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<h4 style="text-align: justify;">Update 15&nbsp;- Board of Education and District Administration Present Detailed Referendum Overview (May 11, 2026)</h4>

<p style="text-align: justify;">During the Monday, May 11, 2026 Board of Education meeting, District leadership presented an overview of the proposed fall 2026 bond referendum, including its purpose, potential state aid, and how it would fund major school improvements over time. The presentation also explained the structure of the two ballot questions and provided details on proposed projects, such as upgrades to instructional spaces, infrastructure, safety and security, and outdoor facilities. Additionally, an update on current building conditions and ongoing state funding considerations were shared.</p>

<p style="text-align: justify;">For more information, please see the full slideshow and meeting recording&nbsp;below.&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a data-file-name="ReferendumPresentationMay11.pdf" data-resource-uuid="fcd43248-0ca7-48eb-ab7b-11ba4c47ee10" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/fcd43248-0ca7-48eb-ab7b-11ba4c47ee10" target="_blank" title="Referendum presentation slideshow."><span class="button-large-1">Slideshow Presentation</span></a></p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/-KdhMdx7AsE?si=mSTbu_BxKbx_OSqs" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to Referendum Meeting recording."><span class="button-large-1">Meeting Recording</span></a></p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a data-file-name="LettertoCommunity-05-12-2026.pdf" data-resource-uuid="235bb8ac-e217-4945-a862-b250dfb82389" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/235bb8ac-e217-4945-a862-b250dfb82389" target="_blank" title="Links to Community Letter PDF."><span class="button-large-1">Community Letter</span></a></p>


	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	
	<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleOneThird fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-2 fsStyleColumn-last fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8266"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsResourceElement fsSingleItem" id="fsEl_8268" data-use-new="true" data-source-element-id="8268" data-source-page-id="1315" data-display-items="collections_and_resources" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<article class="fsResource fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><picture><img alt="" data-aspect-ratio="1.25" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1778592587/westexorg/fsxji8vd85bhte2yb8wn/WestEssexReferendumMay11FollowUp.png%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1778592587/westexorg/fsxji8vd85bhte2yb8wn/WestEssexReferendumMay11FollowUp.png%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1778592587/westexorg/fsxji8vd85bhte2yb8wn/WestEssexReferendumMay11FollowUp.png%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1778592587/westexorg/fsxji8vd85bhte2yb8wn/WestEssexReferendumMay11FollowUp.png%22,%22width%22:1080}]" data-permitted-user="true" data-resource-title="WestEssexReferendumMay11FollowUp.png" data-resource-uuid="780af785-b7cf-45c4-bc07-6a5eecd39e43"></picture></figure></article>
	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	




	</div>
	


	</div>


	</section>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsPanel fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8188" data-use-new="true" role="tabpanel" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8188"><a role='button' aria-controls='fsPanelContent_8188' aria-expanded='false' href='#fs-panel-8188'>5/1/2026 | Upcoming Meeting Reminder</a></h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" aria-hidden="true">
		<a id="fs-panel-8188"></a>
	<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnWideLeftLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8190" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleTwoThirds fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8191"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_8192" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<h4 style="text-align: justify;">Update 14&nbsp;- Reminder About Upcoming Referendum Board Meeting &amp; Presentation&nbsp;(May 1,&nbsp;8, &amp; 11, 2026)</h4>

<p style="text-align: justify;">On May 1, 2026 (and again on May 8, 2026 and May 11, 2026)&nbsp;Superintendent Macioci and Board President Wojtowicz sent a community letter reminding the public that they are cordially invited to the upcoming Board of Education meeting where referendum information will be provided.&nbsp; The meeting will take place on Monday, May 11, 2026, at 7:30 p.m. in the West Essex High School Auditorium.</p>

<p style="text-align: justify;">During the meeting, district leadership will present an overview of the proposed fall 2026 bond referendum, including its purpose, potential state aid, and how it would fund major school improvements over time. The presentation will also explain the structure of the two ballot questions and provide details on proposed projects, such as upgrades to instructional spaces, infrastructure, safety and security, and outdoor facilities. Additionally, an update on current building conditions and ongoing state funding considerations will be shared.</p>

<p style="text-align: justify;">For more information, please see the full letter below.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a data-file-name="LettertoCommunity-05-01-2026.pdf" data-resource-uuid="4c0913d1-4d00-44bd-b9bd-dbe3c415e75c" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/4c0913d1-4d00-44bd-b9bd-dbe3c415e75c" target="_blank" title="Referendum letter from Superintendent Macioci and Board President Wojtowicz regarding upcoming meeting."><span class="button-large-1">5/1 Letter</span></a></p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a data-page-name="Meeting Livestreams &amp; Recordings" href="/fs/pages/1251" target="_blank"><span class="button-large-1">Join Meeting Virtually</span></a></p>


	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	
	<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleOneThird fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-2 fsStyleColumn-last fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8193"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsResourceElement fsSingleItem" id="fsEl_8194" data-use-new="true" data-source-element-id="8194" data-source-page-id="1315" data-display-items="collections_and_resources" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<article class="fsResource fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><picture><img alt="Poster for referendum presentation on May 11 at 7:30 PM, WEHS Auditorium. A student high-fives a person in knight armor. Red and black theme." data-aspect-ratio="1.25" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1777517336/westexorg/muzvesxuxxmfod7fl8el/MAY11.png%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1777517336/westexorg/muzvesxuxxmfod7fl8el/MAY11.png%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1777517336/westexorg/muzvesxuxxmfod7fl8el/MAY11.png%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1777517336/westexorg/muzvesxuxxmfod7fl8el/MAY11.png%22,%22width%22:1080}]" data-permitted-user="true" data-resource-title="MAY11.png" data-resource-uuid="3e0c9394-2a62-4fc3-9d35-83dd0ca16981"></picture></figure></article>
